            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.108,
            0.105,
            0.419,
            0.127
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验仪器、材料和试剂】"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.108,
            0.141,
            0.892,
            0.183
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 仪器、用具: 分析天平、超净工作台、高压灭菌锅、培养箱或培养室、剪刀、镊子、手术刀、电炉、烧杯、试剂瓶、培养瓶、酒精灯、精密 pH 试纸。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.185,
            0.476,
            0.202
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 材料:胡萝卜块根、菊花花瓣。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.207,
            0.895,
            0.247
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（3）试剂:6-苄基氨基嘌呤（6-BA）、2,4-D、NAA、1mol/L NaOH、1mol/L HCl、0.1%升汞（HgCl₂）、乙醇、蔗糖、琼脂。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.261,
            0.285,
            0.283
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【方法与步骤】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.296,
            0.477,
            0.316
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（一）胡萝卜块根的脱分化培养"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.333,
            0.249,
            0.35
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. 母液的配制"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.354,
            0.895,
            0.394
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "在配制培养基时，为了使用方便，避免每次配制称量的麻烦，通常将各种成分配成比培养基需要量大（10～100）×的母液（以 MS 为例，配制方法见表 8-1）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.432,
            0.894,
            0.829
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "table_caption",
              "index": 10,
              "bbox": [
                0.41,
                0.414,
                0.597,
                0.429
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "表 8-1 MS 培养基配方"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 11,
              "bbox": [
                0.114,
                0.432,
                0.894,
                0.829
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_1_table_11.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tr><td>类型</td><td>成分</td><td>培养基中工作液浓度/(mg/L)</td><td>配制母液称取量/mg</td><td>母液体积/ml</td><td>配1L培养基的吸取量/ml</td><td>扩大倍数</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"5\">大量元素</td><td><eq>KNO_3</eq></td><td>1900</td><td>19000</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><eq>NH_4NO_3</eq></td><td>1650</td><td>16500</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><eq>MgSO_4·7H_2O</eq></td><td>370</td><td>3700</td><td>1000</td><td>100</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td><eq>KH_2PO_4</eq></td><td>170</td><td>1700</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><eq>CaCl_2·2H_2O</eq></td><td>440</td><td>4400</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"7\">微量元素</td><td><eq>MnSO_4·4H_2O</eq></td><td>22.3</td><td>2230</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><eq>ZnSO_4·7H_2O</eq></td><td>8.6</td><td>860</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><eq>H_3BO_3</eq></td><td>6.2</td><td>620</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>KI</td><td>0.83</td><td>83</td><td>1000</td><td>10</td><td>100</td></tr><tr><td><eq>Na_2MoO_4·2H_2O</eq></td><td>0.25</td><td>25</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><eq>CuSO_4·5H_2O</eq></td><td>0.025</td><td>2.5</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><eq>CoCl_2·6H_2O</eq></td><td>0.025</td><td>2.5</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">铁盐</td><td><eq>Na_2-EDTA</eq></td><td>37.3</td><td>3730</td><td>1000</td><td>10</td><td>100</td></tr><tr><td><eq>FeSO_4·7H_2O</eq></td><td>27.8</td><td>2780</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"5\">有机物质</td><td>甘氨酸</td><td>2.0</td><td>100</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>盐酸硫胺素</td><td>0.4</td><td>20</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>盐酸吡哆素</td><td>0.5</td><td>25</td><td>500</td><td>10</td><td>50</td></tr><tr><td>烟酸</td><td>0.5</td><td>25</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>肌醇</td><td>100</td><td>5000</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.84,
            0.9,
            0.902
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "配制母液时必须要注意，各种化学物质必须一一充分溶解后才能混合，以避免药物间出现化学反应产生沉淀。某些生长素，如2,4-D、IAA、NAA等，应先用少量95%乙醇溶解，最后再加水定容。Kt、6-BA、2ip、ZT等细胞分裂素，应先用少量1mol/L"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.059,
            0.193,
            0.072
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "116"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.436,
            0.057,
            0.601,
            0.073
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "细胞生物学实验教程"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.127,
            0.093,
            0.886,
            0.111
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "HCl 或 NaOH 溶解，最后再加水定容。配好的母液要标记好配制日期及药物的浓度。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.127,
            0.115,
            0.285,
            0.132
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. 培养基的配制"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.126,
            0.136,
            0.912,
            0.198
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "把母液按编号顺序排列好，取大烧杯一个，先加入约 300ml 蒸馏水，按设计好的培养基分别吸取母液，最后定容到所需的量。调 pH 至 5.8，每升培养基中加入 6.5g 琼脂粉和 30g 蔗糖煮溶。分装到培养瓶中，封好瓶口。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.126,
            0.202,
            0.914,
            0.33
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "基本培养基种类和附加成分是根据培养材料和目的来确定的。下列培养基及附加成分可作为组织培养实验的参考依据。MS 培养基附加 2,4-D 2mg/L 和 6-BA 0.2mg/L，适合胡萝卜块根愈伤组织的诱导。Miller 或  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "N_{6}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  培养基附加 2,4-D 0.5mg/L，适合水稻花药愈伤组织诱导；而附加 NAA 0.5～2mg/L 和 6-BA 3mg/L 则适合水稻花药愈伤组织分化为单倍体植株。MS 培养基附加 NAA 0.1mg/L 和 6-BA 3mg/L 适合菊花花瓣诱导分化。MS 培养基附加 NAA 0.5mg/L 适合多种花卉植物的根分化。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.333,
            0.205,
            0.349
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. 灭菌"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.127,
            0.354,
            0.914,
            0.439
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "把分装好的培养基及接种用具放入高压消毒锅进行灭菌消毒。当压力升到 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0.5\\mathrm{kg/cm}^2"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 时，打开放气阀，放气 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5\\mathrm{min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 后，再把放气阀关上；当压力升到 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1.1\\mathrm{kg/cm}^2"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 或 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0.11\\mathrm{MPa}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 时，开始计时，维持 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0.11\\mathrm{MPa}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 压力灭菌 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "15\\sim 20\\mathrm{min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。灭菌后应把培养基放在干净处冷却待用。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.443,
            0.268,
            0.46
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. 取材与消毒"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.464,
            0.912,
            0.526
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "在自来水中反复冲洗干净胡萝卜块根，切取中间长约 50mm 一段，在超净工作台上，放入无菌烧杯中，经 70% 乙醇浸泡 5min 后，再用饱和漂白粉液消毒 20～30min。倒去消毒液，用无菌水洗 3～5 次。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.53,
            0.206,
            0.547
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5. 接种"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.552,
            0.915,
            0.637
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "在超净工作台上，用经高压消毒的镊子和解剖刀把材料两端厚约10mm的部分切去不用，中间的一段切成厚约5mm的圆片，最后把圆片切成 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5mm^{3}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的组织块（注意每块都应带有形成层），接种在MS+2,4-D 2mg/L+6-BA 0.2mg/L的培养基中。接种后，要在包头纸上写清楚材料名称、培养基代号、接种日期、姓名等。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.13,
            0.64,
            0.207,
            0.657
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6. 培养"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.662,
            0.914,
            0.703
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "接种后的材料放在 26～28℃ 条件下黑暗培养 2～3 周，即可出现愈伤组织，培养 4～6 周，愈伤组织达到高峰。每隔一周观察记录培养物的形态变化。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.171,
            0.715,
            0.449,
            0.735
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（二）菊花花瓣的分化培养"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.749,
            0.268,
            0.766
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. 配制培养基"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.772,
            0.915,
            0.811
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "适合菊花花瓣分化培养的培养基为 MS+6-BA 3mg/L+NAA 0.1mg/L+糖 3%+琼脂 0.7%，pH5.8。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.13,
            0.815,
            0.33,
            0.832
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. 外植体的灭菌消毒"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.837,
            0.916,
            0.9
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "选取新鲜的菊花花瓣，用洗衣粉洗净表面，自来水冲洗30min，再用吸水纸吸干水分。然后移入超净工作台，用70%乙醇消毒30s，接着用饱和漂白粉液消毒20min或0.1%  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "HgCl_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  溶液消毒10min。最后用无菌水洗5或6次，灭菌过的滤纸吸干水分。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 3,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.381,
            0.054,
            0.616,
            0.07
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "第八章 细胞和组织培养技术"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.825,
            0.054,
            0.86,
            0.069
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "117"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.108,
            0.09,
            0.226,
            0.108
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. 接种培养"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.108,
            0.111,
            0.895,
            0.217
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "用灭菌的剪刀把花瓣头尾剪去，剪成一或两段，接种在 MS+6-BA 3mg/L+NAA 0.1mg/L 的培养基中，经 26~28℃，光照强度 1000~2000lx，每天光照 12h，培养 14 天左右，就可诱导出愈伤组织，再培养 10~15 天便可分化出不定芽。当芽长到 1~2cm 时，分割芽转入 MS+NAA 0.5mg/L 生根培养基中，继续培养 10 天左右，就可以长出白根，形成完整的植株。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.228,
            0.257,
            0.25
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【注意事项】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.261,
            0.658,
            0.28
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）接种用的工具、器皿、培养基必须要经过高压灭菌。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.283,
            0.894,
            0.323
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（2）接种前要用紫外线消毒接种室 20min，接种者要用肥皂洗干净双手，然后用沾以 70%乙醇的棉球把手和指尖消毒 1 次。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.325,
            0.66,
            0.345
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 严格按照无菌操作的要求进行操作，尽量减少污染。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.355,
            0.204,
            0.379
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【作业】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.39,
            0.558,
            0.408
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）接种后1周，观察记录培养物有无污染。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.412,
            0.538,
            0.43
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（2）每隔1周观察记录培养物的生长情况。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.809,
            0.454,
            0.895,
            0.471
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(何炎明)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.284,
            0.512,
            0.727,
            0.536
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "实验 40 原生质体的分离和培养"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.545,
            0.262,
            0.567
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验目的】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.578,
            0.899,
            0.62
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "掌握植物原生质体的分离、提纯和培养技术，观察原生质体再生壁和细胞分裂过程。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.631,
            0.262,
            0.653
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验原理】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.664,
            0.902,
            0.877
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "植物原生质体是去除了细胞壁的裸露的细胞。原生质体可从培养的单细胞、愈伤组织和植物器官（叶、下胚轴等）中获得。但一般认为从叶肉组织分离到的原生质体是理想的材料，其优点是材料来源方便，供应及时，而且遗传性较为一致。而从单细胞和愈伤组织分离到的原生质体，由于受培养条件和继代培养的影响，细胞间易发生遗传和生理差异。所以，从培养的单细胞和愈伤组织中获得的原生质体不是十分理想的材料。原生质体的分离通常采用酶解法，对细胞壁成分进行降解后分离得到。在适宜的培养条件下，分离的原生质体，又可重新合成新的细胞壁，经过细胞分裂并再生成完整的植株。原生质体培养的条件和对营养的要求与组织、细胞培养相似。但由于原生质体去除了细胞壁，所以培养基中用一定浓度的渗透压稳定剂来保持原生质体的稳定。常用的渗透压稳定剂包括甘露醇、山梨醇、蔗糖等。培养基中添加的生长素、细胞分裂素也是必需的。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.879,
            0.901,
            0.898
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "高等植物原生质体除了用于细胞融合的研究以外，还能通过它们裸露的质膜摄入外"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
